          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description">This ability always takes the form Deadly Demise X. Each time a model with this ability is destroyed, after the units embarked within it (if any) have made their emergency disembark moves, roll one D6. On a 6, that model suffers a deadly demise; each unit within 6&quot; of that model suffers a number of mortal wounds denoted by X (if this is a random number, roll separately for each unit within 6&quot;).</characteristic>
